Work unit = 10,000 candidate strings
Total test range = 10,000,000
GatorLink prefix = psheshadrireddy;

We actually tested different work-unit sizes on your Mac:

Work unit	Approx. runtime
5,000	0.542 s
10,000	0.512 s
25,000	0.520 s
50,000	0.526 s

So 10,000 was the fastest among the sizes we tested.


to run this
-> erlc project1.erl
-> erlc worker.erl
-> (type a no) 4

in another terminal
-> ./project1 192.168.0.50 